00:35:11.740 --> 00:35:13.600
What? Surely

00:35:13.600 --> 00:35:15.880
a beautiful young thing like you

00:35:15.880 --> 00:35:17.800
can bewitch a human heart

00:35:17.800 --> 00:35:20.190
without a voice. And don't forget

00:35:20.190 --> 00:35:22.450
soon you'll have the prettiest

00:35:22.450 --> 00:35:23.950
little white legs as well.

00:35:24.210 --> 00:35:26.210
By tomorrow morning you'll be able

00:35:26.210 --> 00:35:29.470
