00:35:37.930 --> 00:35:40.770
No, you must do it, no matter what.

00:35:41.340 --> 00:35:42.260
Make me a human.

00:35:42.600 --> 00:35:59.960
This potion will...

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:08.550
lose its effect unless you take it by sunrise tomorrow. Oh, Marina. Do it. I've had enough

00:36:08.550 --> 00:36:28.650
of you interrupting me when I feel so right. Marina. Everything. She took away your voice.

00:36:30.800 --> 00:36:34.080
I won't ever hear your beautiful voice again, will I?

00:36:34.510 --> 00:36:41.630
Oh, Marina, I don't want you to become a human.

00:37:12.800 --> 00:37:13.580
Goodbye, father.

00:37:15.800 --> 00:37:21.340
My dear sisters, farewell.

00:37:23.770 --> 00:37:25.970
I must reach the Fijal River by tomorrow morning.

00:37:27.710 --> 00:37:28.410
And Fritz?

00:37:29.430 --> 00:37:29.970
I can go.

00:37:30.030 --> 00:37:36.970
with you as far as the summer palace no it'd just be harder goodbye my wonderful fritz no marina

00:38:50.990 --> 00:38:51.350
You

00:39:05.720 --> 00:39:06.020
Oh, my God.

00:40:23.550 --> 00:40:27.280
Are you alright? Wake up. Please wake up.

00:40:30.480 --> 00:40:31.720
Thank God you're all right.

00:40:32.120 --> 00:40:33.520
You gave me quite a fright.

00:40:34.550 --> 00:40:41.820
It's all right.

00:40:42.060 --> 00:40:42.800
You're safe now.

00:40:43.130 --> 00:40:44.170
