00:40:59.180 --> 00:40:59.660
Somebody!

00:41:00.670 --> 00:41:09.160
Oh, Jimmy, you won't need any help.

00:41:09.340 --> 00:41:16.380
Oh, poor thing she hasn't got any clothes on.

00:41:16.400 --> 00:41:19.460
Hold it. Some tutor you are a fine thing.

00:41:20.200 --> 00:41:20.920
Now then.

00:41:34.600 --> 00:41:35.820
Where did she have come from?

00:41:37.500 --> 00:41:41.080
Good. The princess clothes fit you perfectly.

00:41:41.420 --> 00:41:44.020
