00:42:06.940 --> 00:42:07.220
What?

00:42:09.180 --> 00:42:11.580
Heavens, child, you don't intend to give it to me.

00:42:11.700 --> 00:42:13.960
It's very beautiful, and I thank you for that thought.

00:42:14.080 --> 00:42:16.360
But such treasures were never meant for the likes of me.

00:42:17.410 --> 00:42:18.950
Where on earth does she come from?

00:42:19.450 --> 00:42:23.150
She's so lovely, and her manners are too good for her to be a commoner.

00:42:23.600 --> 00:42:25.880
No, she just has to come from a royal household.

00:42:25.900 --> 00:42:26.660
But which one?

00:42:26.980 --> 00:42:29.800
Oh, they must have been on a void somewhere where they were kidnapped.

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:50.130
by pirates you know if your hair were shorter we'd look just like twins don't you want to speak

00:42:50.130 --> 00:42:54.840
to me are you shy don't be afraid i'd never hurt you

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:06.450
You can't speak. Don't worry. You can write, can't you?

00:43:10.620 --> 00:43:12.840
There, write something. Write down your name.

00:43:16.040 --> 00:43:19.340
You know, I keep getting this feeling that I've seen you before somewhere.

00:43:19.380 --> 00:43:25.610
But where? What are you trying to tell me?

00:43:40.750 --> 00:43:41.930
A month has passed.

00:43:44.270 --> 00:43:47.990
Marina has not found it easy to adapt to life on dry land,

00:43:48.170 --> 00:43:50.010
but she is happy to be with the prince.

00:44:14.170 --> 00:44:26.100
Your music has the sound of the sea in it, the gentle rippling of the waves on a calm, beautiful day, and sometimes just the hint of a distant storm.

00:44:28.210 --> 00:44:29.630
You came to me from the sea, too.

00:44:30.600 --> 00:44:32.120
You're my little mermaid princess.

00:44:36.040 --> 00:44:37.080
Do you like that name?

00:44:41.280 --> 00:44:43.680
Then from now on, I shall call you Princess Mermaid.

00:44:43.970 --> 00:44:45.610
It sounds as lovely as you look.

00:44:49.960 --> 00:44:51.000
Look, a dolphin.

00:44:55.570 --> 00:44:57.440
Princess Mermaid, wait.

00:45:01.310 --> 00:45:28.280
See, that's no way to play with living things.

00:45:32.910 --> 00:45:41.900
come to see me in spite of all the danger are you happy marina i miss you so much if you ever need

00:45:41.900 --> 00:45:51.540
me just hold your pearl hairpin high in the air i'll be there fritz fritz fritz do you really

00:45:51.540 --> 00:45:59.980
still think of me hello you'd think that dolphin was a friend of yours but then i

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:08.800
can't imagine anything wishing you harm princess take my hand that's it tomorrow i'll take you

00:46:08.800 --> 00:46:09.920
horseback riding all right

00:46:35.690 --> 00:46:36.910
I'll race you to the lake.

00:46:37.160 --> 00:46:38.340
It's just over there.

00:46:41.390 --> 00:46:41.710
Good.

00:46:54.490 --> 00:46:55.590
You're pretty good.

00:46:56.090 --> 00:46:56.290
Yeah.

00:47:03.870 --> 00:47:05.490
It's just over there, to the right.

00:47:32.360 --> 00:47:36.890
Oh, wolves.

00:47:37.240 --> 00:47:37.800
The princess.

00:47:38.280 --> 00:47:38.720
Hyah!

00:48:03.480 --> 00:48:26.900
Forest, you demons!

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:31.380
Take him away from me, little mermaid.

00:48:31.640 --> 00:48:34.280
You will die, even if he must die with you.

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:04.000
Miserable little wretch. You won't be so lucky next time.

00:49:05.660 --> 00:49:09.290
Get up there, you miserable nag.

00:49:12.580 --> 00:49:13.080
Forward.

00:49:14.600 --> 00:49:19.640
He loves me. He loves me not. He loves me. He loves me not. He loves me.

00:49:20.460 --> 00:49:22.970
What is it, Lord Chamberlain?

00:49:23.790 --> 00:49:28.890
Your father, the king, wants you to attend a meeting concerning your marriage arrangements.

00:49:29.350 --> 00:49:29.710
Marriage?

00:49:32.140 --> 00:49:35.920
You are to meet your future bride, the princess of the Sumio kingdom.

00:49:36.180 --> 00:49:36.900
Sumio kingdom?

00:49:37.100 --> 00:49:40.900
Yes. They say she is very beautiful and very refined as well.

00:49:47.690 --> 00:49:49.770
I will attend no such meeting. I'm sorry.

00:49:50.130 --> 00:49:53.120
What? You have no choice. You must attend.

00:49:53.440 --> 00:49:58.970
Even though you are the prince, the orders of the king and queen are absolute and must be obeyed.

00:50:02.650 --> 00:50:04.770
Don't be unhappy, Princess Mermaid.

00:50:05.130 --> 00:50:07.230
The prince cares for you very much.

00:50:07.570 --> 00:50:10.470
He wouldn't like this other girl even if he did meet her.

00:50:34.570 --> 00:50:43.000
Princess, my parents are demanding that I get married.

00:50:48.300 --> 00:50:52.630
But the only girl I really want is the one I met that morning on the seashore.

00:50:54.490 --> 00:50:57.010
I was on a ship not long ago that ran into a storm.

00:50:57.410 --> 00:50:59.970
I lost consciousness as it sank and the waves cast me up.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:09.340
on the shore. I was saved by a girl with black hair. Black hair? I don't know her name or where

00:51:09.340 --> 00:51:16.350
she is now. I'll probably never see her again. Anyway, since I can't find her, I want to marry

00:51:16.350 --> 00:51:29.590
you. That's the girl he's grown so fond of, is it, Jimmy? Yes. Ridiculous.

00:51:38.830 --> 00:51:40.670
Don't worry, Lord Chamberlain.

00:51:40.790 --> 00:51:42.470
She's only a temporary problem.

00:51:42.770 --> 00:51:44.650
She won't escape me again.

00:51:55.960 --> 00:51:59.380
Why, Jimmy, have you come all the way from the Summer Palace?

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:02.960
Yes, I have something very important to tell you.

00:52:03.080 --> 00:52:04.000
Oh, what's that?

00:52:04.320 --> 00:52:07.160
The prince is against your marriage arrangement

00:52:07.160 --> 00:52:11.100
because of the little mute girl who came to live at the summer palace.

00:52:11.400 --> 00:52:12.500
What mute girl?

00:52:13.220 --> 00:52:14.960
Yes, sire, if you don't...

00:52:15.000 --> 00:52:16.980
put a stop to it quickly. The situation could

00:52:16.980 --> 00:52:18.020
get serious. Oh, my.

00:52:18.560 --> 00:52:27.340
She must have bewitched him. What?

00:52:27.440 --> 00:52:29.390
Mother is sick? Yes, Your Highness.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:31.860
A ship is waiting to take you to the Grand Palace.

00:52:32.060 --> 00:52:33.700
We must leave at once, Princess Mermaid.

00:52:34.444 --> 00:52:36.124
Oh, no. You must go alone.

00:52:37.356 --> 00:52:37.796
Why?

00:52:39.148 --> 00:52:39.928
Well, uh...

00:52:41.004 --> 00:52:44.144
I have taken this girl into my care. She goes where I go.

00:52:44.492 --> 00:52:46.332
Oh, she's such a charming child.

00:52:46.412 --> 00:52:47.232
You must let her go.

00:52:47.232 --> 00:52:47.832
You have my personal...

00:52:47.832 --> 00:52:50.552
Your ship is ready to cast off.

00:53:13.660 --> 00:53:14.400
Princess Mermaid.

00:53:15.260 --> 00:53:16.880
Will you pray with me for my mother?

00:53:17.532 --> 00:53:18.912
so that she can get well soon?

00:53:19.772 --> 00:53:21.372
That will not be necessary.

00:53:21.980 --> 00:53:22.320
Father.

00:53:23.132 --> 00:53:23.792
Mother, too.

00:53:24.380 --> 00:53:27.200
Thank you for your concern, but I have completely recovered.

00:53:27.644 --> 00:53:29.924
We are sailing to the Sumio Kingdom.

00:53:30.636 --> 00:53:31.496
Sumio Kingdom.

00:53:33.868 --> 00:53:36.668
You must discuss your marriage with the princess of the Sumio kingdom.

00:53:37.100 --> 00:53:38.140
You tricked me.

00:53:38.444 --> 00:53:41.004
I'm sorry, but there was no other way, my son.

00:53:41.232 --> 00:53:41.832
Guards?

00:53:42.892 --> 00:53:43.732
Get back!

00:53:43.852 --> 00:53:44.352
Ha-

00:53:46.828 --> 00:53:47.668
Princess?

00:53:50.508 --> 00:53:51.008
Insane!

00:54:02.972 --> 00:54:05.892
If I were able to choose my own bride, Princess Mermaid.

00:54:06.812 --> 00:54:07.612
It would be you.

00:54:08.508 --> 00:54:09.508
my sweet silent one.

00:54:52.236 --> 00:54:53.276
Raise your head.

00:54:53.612 --> 00:54:55.172
And meet the prince, my daughter.

00:54:56.332 --> 00:54:58.332
Greetings, Your Highness.

00:54:59.116 --> 00:54:59.536
Aren't you?

00:55:00.732 --> 00:55:01.492
But you're the one.

00:55:18.588 --> 00:55:18.948
Dreaming.

00:55:20.508 --> 00:55:21.268
So do I.

00:55:21.756 --> 00:55:22.896
Thank you.

00:55:24.220 --> 00:55:25.460
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

00:55:29.116 --> 00:55:29.456
Princess.

00:55:33.292 --> 00:55:36.032
Princess, you won't believe my good fortune.

00:55:36.292 --> 00:55:39.012
The Sumio princess is the same girl that saved my life.

00:55:41.964 --> 00:55:43.924
We're going to announce our marriage immediately.

00:56:41.000 --> 00:56:52.300
Fritz, you look so sad.

00:56:52.520 --> 00:56:53.280
What's the matter?

00:56:53.540 --> 00:56:54.880
Is the prince gonna marry another?

00:56:56.020 --> 00:56:58.360
Oh no, Marina, it can't be true.

00:56:58.730 --> 00:56:59.970
If he marries another...

00:57:00.600 --> 00:57:05.480
Then, the morning after his wedding, he'll be turned to foam.

00:57:06.110 --> 00:57:07.570
Isn't that what the sea witch said?

00:57:08.360 --> 00:57:08.820
No!

00:57:27.580 --> 00:57:28.820
You're too good, Marika!

00:57:32.170 --> 00:57:32.330
Yeah!

00:58:26.620 --> 00:58:27.760
The ceremony is over.

00:58:29.150 --> 00:58:29.890
It will soon be done.

00:58:31.440 --> 00:58:33.700
The first ray of sunshine will bring my death.

00:59:00.210 --> 00:59:00.330
Thank you.

00:59:35.400 --> 00:59:43.480
her hair. What happened? Marina, look. We gave our hair to the sea witch. We needed her help to save

00:59:43.480 --> 00:59:52.220
your life. She cut off our hair, but in return she gave us a magic knife for you. Fritz, Fritz,

00:59:54.180 --> 00:59:57.340
it's the only way out, Marina. Watch it, Marina.

01:00:05.340 --> 01:00:08.120
You must plunge the knife into the prince's heart.

01:00:08.340 --> 01:00:12.940
When his blood sprinkles your feet, they'll join together and become a tail.

01:00:13.120 --> 01:00:14.740
You'll become a mermaid again.

01:00:15.040 --> 01:00:17.760
Once you've slain the prince, you'll be out of danger.

01:00:18.000 --> 01:00:19.240
But you must hurry.

01:00:19.620 --> 01:00:22.200
Father and grandmother are very worried about you.

01:00:22.500 --> 01:00:24.380
You can be with us again, Marina.

01:00:24.920 --> 01:00:27.380
Be quick. The sun will rise soon.

01:00:27.920 --> 01:00:28.400
Marina!

01:00:34.730 --> 01:00:35.550
We'll be waiting.

01:02:35.340 --> 01:02:37.410
Can't. Can't do it.

01:02:38.600 --> 01:02:40.480
The prince's happiness is my happiness.

01:03:18.520 --> 01:03:22.020
Yes, it's the only way.

01:03:23.820 --> 01:03:28.500
I must return to the sea, where I was born, where I belong.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:34.340
Only through my death can I keep my love for the Prince true and pure.

01:03:35.230 --> 01:03:40.300
And perhaps, when I have turned to sea foam, foam upon the waves,

01:03:41.010 --> 01:03:44.810
I may yet find a way to be of service to my Prince and to others.

01:03:45.530 --> 01:03:47.950
For though his heart was never meant to be mine,

01:03:48.640 --> 01:03:51.770
nevertheless, I have learned the meaning of true love.

01:03:52.620 --> 01:03:55.610
I want to be with him and around him always,

01:03:56.450 --> 01:03:59.970
even if it is only in the form of a clear, fine sea foam.

01:04:00.030 --> 01:04:04.290
Goodbye, father, grandmother.

01:04:05.540 --> 01:04:06.580
Goodbye, my sisters.

01:04:07.890 --> 01:04:09.690
I'm sorry I couldn't meet you tonight.

01:04:11.170 --> 01:04:13.070
Goodbye, dear brave Fritz.

01:04:15.590 --> 01:04:17.010
Farewell, sweet prince.

01:04:18.230 --> 01:04:19.470
May happiness be yours.

01:04:49.770 --> 01:04:54.270
Princess, wait! Princess Mermaid!

01:05:04.090 --> 01:05:05.090
Princess and maid.

01:07:12.930 --> 01:07:16.820
So, the little mermaid's soul ascended to heaven.

01:07:48.200 --> 01:07:53.140
Eventually, the little mermaid's soul was allowed to return from heaven to the sea,

01:07:53.710 --> 01:07:58.480
where it had dissolved to foam with the coming of dawn's first light.

01:08:11.260 --> 01:08:12.720
From that time on.

01:08:13.404 --> 01:08:14.404
through her story.

01:08:14.940 --> 01:08:16.400
The story of her love.

01:08:16.796 --> 01:08:17.696
and her courage.

01:08:18.460 --> 01:08:21.200
She has guided the wayward hearts of men.

01:08:23.004 --> 01:08:24.144
And so she shall.

01:08:25.116 --> 01:08:25.616
forever.
